<title>NETHERLANDS: BESI returns to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>BESI returns to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-December, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.44 vs   1.15**</p>
<p>    Net profit			    37.8  vs  29.0**</p>
<p>    Turnover			     480.0  vs 384.50**</p>
<p>Note - Full name is BE Semiconductor Industries.</p>
<p>**The company said the 1995 results were adjusted pro-forma to reflect the acquisition of Meco International as if this deal had occurred on January 1, 1995. Unadjusted for the acquisition, BESI reported a full-year loss of 20.1 million guilders in 1995.</p>
<p>Included in the pro-forma information are adjustments reflecting a non-recurring charge of NLG 44.4 million in the second quarter of 1995 for the acquisition of Meco and a non-cash management compensation charge of NLG 11.3 million in the third quarter of 1  </p>
<p>     Operating income		    60.88 vs  42.45**</p>
<p>    Net interest expenses		2.99 vs    4.25**</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income			58.17 vs   38.84**</p>
<p>    Tax				     20.42 vs    9.88**</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
